it.
展现自我。

905
00:38:56.800 --> 00:38:57.060
Yeah.
没错。

906
00:38:57.220 --> 00:38:57.960
Very smart.
非常聪明。

907
00:38:58.340 --> 00:38:58.540
Yeah.
没错。

908
00:39:09.300 --> 00:39:12.460
So we've talked about you a lot on the podcast before, Allison.
所以，艾莉森，我们在播客里经常提到你。

909
00:39:12.840 --> 00:39:18.140
And we've had a lot of guests come on who are actors who were on the show, a lot
我们邀请过很多曾参演该剧的演员，很多客串明星，

